 "id": "2119606918851969", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_2119606922185302_4950834086101963391_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1qzi3ctxnsEQ7kNvwFnTMO6&_nc_oc=AdqYREdYrvEl1GyJotDeyQLissgwaVDNkzsnyMmaLjNsNfiFf07fwHBJS1Tpj4xbS-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC8QQXG3nSelfQ8t5RMOCbm9182MNqMYAmm7xpP-45dBQ&oe=6A6B660B"}, {"file_name": "cover_portrait.png", "id": "1504876887271217", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617831_1504876890604550_2890532527553518013_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hM9VWMUaIQEQ7kNvwErqLbE&_nc_oc=AdrFgi-OksobagrSdaCMPglE-EReAmQo-CbV-oK7T1HWzxreLLQlSzY1_mwfU07Xzn0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBQkFAAUKnBgv40gEQdDi7wEwa6h78uQbcC1Jzkw9Vqsg&oe=6A6B4F0B"}, {"file_name": "cover_square.png", "id": "1434317035083431", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622334_1434317038416764_4990668168972632832_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B2_DlmkVX-8Q7kNvwFSH-WW&_nc_oc=AdqO-B1nkf88R7XMm3mqptHjZqhCH13nAbuvwUAZypt7TtSXBOKo8C9ULinj1sj9A3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCCPr7oFjds88Khub6DgltKCMBJ13s5AZm2GBKOSJpR6w&oe=6A6B49F7"}, {"file_name": "cover_hero.png", "id": "925721709916061", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819324_925721713249394_2252932449268954893_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hpbAa3V4zJwQ7kNvwF_5utQ&_nc_oc=Adq2oNgAMepb5LkbCyZ7Nld46Kp43mbd0hE2hp4OHja0EcpAfTfT1c6-vR5sDwWZL38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQALdN5gEFjeDh_o3RkeSDxyAcZk5JHoZI3sAky2nxFkOA&oe=6A6B3B18"}]}, "id": "2713860495679965", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260222-171729.png", "id": "1244881073644028", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619704_1244881076977361_5615678092938328795_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bMxclqnGjakQ7kNvwGqFwFR&_nc_oc=AdqJtpQNjUZJYoRuCFwFR1zrGERRVbeW6jTEGTkjNTXDQO-M1Qx1C9i-XNYR8tEU16Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAjWxxoC8vM2Pf7Rv6fA-hpGWnXI8MBY9RM8Fd2-b-96Q&oe=6A6B46BA"}, {"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260222-171803.png", "id": "878545175052858", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_878545181719524_1967766508375899942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=duvPc6WXVRoQ7kNvwG1_EuY&_nc_oc=AdojTmGfDT2JnTbG30n0-rq2BuMxz-drljm3kHbKepGGJIJNITlPiDRMr9XwlfRnYqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBv7KQn7tpsNybfEmZObr82d0mK8StsLlmZjdzna6ssGg&oe=6A6B5C5D"}, {"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260222-171753.png", "id": "2355644911606270", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_2355644914939603_7881252502421777745_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hYuLnApSP7YQ7kNvwG9ojlC&_nc_oc=AdrqWDg0xviZl9CwF8isUVpU7pGDKYbkWD_WAgw5Yu3On_NGo4ceOt45srgRHMvVAaQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBBN01w9TCjxBudbiS7MikEkp_zd9enmbMnPv5c5FT43w&oe=6A6B6B12"}, {"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260222-171744.png", "id": "1574678113766454", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308961_1574678117099787_7551936325078272668_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7T_mV8mdjTsQ7kNvwEkwFGz&_nc_oc=AdqzkXU5YyW10ARlp2E5VNmIOY9I_vnWtTNjXQB63BHqNLyjI2YL9W1IaEgs5vXK4ms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDrmTw9tny2BEwGc15GIeAcel8nHGTGEH8sLo6WOG34BQ&oe=6A6B45E9"}, {"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260222-171747.png", "id": "936482305505709", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_936482308839042_2870889141134525125_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gxGECzL14OIQ7kNvwEX93QY&_nc_oc=Adrgiu5TUMcuabViK0hc8R3eTFK6Cx6-JSF4oHddE49tVzXTkZp78cPVIi5CHcX1-0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDimSXwyS-yGQW8AAMLhHJcvtqjHYuV8rUT5oGXmX7TNA&oe=6A6B561F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape.png", "id": "1595686508155082", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_1595686511488415_510087455054191114_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qs677UY_WvgQ7kNvwG5w646&_nc_oc=AdqmAYK7KJHzjBGG4uPqAp4Rh-zLtgeTYLlyHcGKCgcVG8J_-ogk3F5TW-JxwHwIgZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBoUiG_CGneNsUhVgl7CSGn1xXatoYaLhpo1fFrABOJRw&oe=6A6B5BD6"}, "display_name": "Boxing Drills VR", "keywords": ["boxing", "padwork", "trainer", "drills", "speed"], "long_description": "# Train Like a Real Boxer\n\nBoxing Drills VR brings authentic pad training to your Quest. No gym required.\n\n**Realistic Drills**\n\nFollow a virtual trainer through classic boxing combinations:\n- **1-2 (Jab-Cross)** - The fundamental combo\n- **1-2-Duck** - Add defensive movement\n- **1-2-3** - Jab, Cross, Hook\n- **1-2-3-2** - Extended combinations\n- **Uppercut combos** - Work those body shots\n- **Growing Library** - A vast selection of drills with new content added regularly!\n\n**Built for Performance**\n\nWe know every millisecond counts when you're in the pocket.\n- Low-Latency Precision: Built from the ground up for high-performance tracking.\n- Native Feel: Optimized to ensure smooth, responsive feedback that feels like hitting real pads.\n\n**Get Scored**\n\nEvery session tracks your performance:\n- **Power** - Hit those pads hard\n- **Speed** - Quick reactions matter\n- **Agility** - Duck and weave like a pro\n- **Form** - Return to guard after every punch\n\n**Train Your Way**\n- Multiple drill durations (30s to 3 min)\n- Choose the speed that suits you (slow, medium, fast, progressive, variable)\n- Passthrough mode - train safely in your own space\n\n**Perfect For**\n- Beginners learning boxing basics\n- Fitness enthusiasts wanting a fun workout\n- Experienced boxers staying sharp\n\nNo experience needed. Just clear some space, put on your Quest, and start throwing punches.\n\n**Shape the Future (Open Source)**\n\nWe believe the best training tools are built by the community. We are moving toward an open-source model so the community can help us shape the roadmap of the product.", "short_description": "Train like a boxer in VR. Follow realistic pad drills with jabs, crosses, hooks, and uppercuts. Practice defense with duck-and-weave combos. Track your power, speed, and form after every session."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://boxing-drills-ec8acc.gitlab.io/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://boxing-drills-ec8acc.gitlab.io/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Wobble Bot Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://boxing-drills-ec8acc.gitlab.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26010917265210852"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1005552205303411"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1657151418799256"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "899033179613105"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4443476652641359"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "899033179613105"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1784566800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1005552205303411"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27936345469334679", "version": "0.34.4"}, "id": "790503750728261", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26010917241877521", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27936345469334679"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "790503750728261"}]}, "change_log": "### v0.34.4\n\n**Build your own workouts**\n- Make custom workout lists. Press Y on any drill to drop it into List A, B, or C, then play that list as a workout.\n- Built a random workout you liked? Save it to a list to run it again.\n- Manage your lists from the Workout tab: remove a drill you don't want, or clear a whole list at once.\n- RANDOMIZE reshuffles a list's drills and their order each time you press it.\n\n**Find drills faster**\n- Filter a category down to what you want with tags: slips, hooks, body shots, ducks, pivots, combo length, and whether a drill leans high-output or defensive.\n- Tags show on each drill card, and search matches them too.\n\n**Perfect combo callout**\n- Finish a whole combo with every shot clean and a coach calls it out.\n\n**Workout flow**\n- Workouts get their own rest-between-combos switch, on by default, so they flow without changing how single drills feel.\n\n**Fixes**\n- Dodging now follows the way you're facing. After a pivot or an angle step, slips and pull-backs work in the direction shown instead of the one the drill started in.", "created_date": 1784928351, "id": "27936345469334679", "version": "0.34.4", "version_code": 16779197, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26010917241877521", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27936345469334679"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "790503750728261"}]}, "change_log": "### v0.34.3\n\n**New drill: SLIP & RIP**\n- Slip left and rip the body, slip right and rip the uppercut, cap it with the hook, then weave off the line. A longer defensive answer built around slipping both ways.\n\n**Rest between combos**\n- A short pause now falls between combos so each one lands as one burst instead of running together. There's a new Settings toggle, \"Rest Between Combos\", if you want the old continuous flow back.\n\n**Footwork**\n- Footwork steps are smaller now, short controlled slides like real footwork, and the same size at every league.\n\n**Fixes**\n- Slip drills: standing still now counts as getting tagged instead of scoring a hit as a success.\n- SLIP SCHOOL: your guard no longer blocks the slips, so you can keep your hands up and just slip.", "created_date": 1784794045, "id": "27916867304615829", "version": "0.34.3", "version_code": 16779182, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26010917241877521", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27936345469334679"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "790503750728261"}]}, "change_log": "### v0.34.2\n\n**New drill: SLIP SCHOOL**\n- Nothing but slips, one after another, for the whole round. Each one comes straight at your face and you dodge it whichever way you like, then snap back to your stance for the next.\n- It sits under Defense, and the speed follows your league so it stays readable instead of becoming a blur.\n\n**Slip fixes**\n- Slips now stay on target until they reach you, so they stop disappearing early.\n- Fixed the odd phantom slip that cleared before you'd actually moved. Every drill with a slip in it feels tighter now.\n\n**Other**\n- A couple of new tips on the loading screen.", "created_date": 1784672294, "id": "27900017142967512", "version": "0.34.2", "version_code": 16779175, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26010917241877521", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27936345469334679"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "790503750728261"}]}, "change_log": "### v0.34.1\n\n**Rear hook drills**\n- Four new drills built around the rear hook.\n- 1-4 (Combos): jab to blind them, loop the right hook around the guard.\n- 8-4 (Combos): right hook to the body, then the same hand upstairs. Sell the level change.\n- SLIP & HOOK (Defense): slip outside the jab, counter with the rear hook as your weight comes back.\n- ROLL & REAR HOOK (Defense): roll under the lead hook, come up with the right hand loaded. The mirror of ROLL & HOOK.\n- In southpaw stance all four mirror to the left hand, like every other drill.", "created_date": 1784499058, "id": "27876947028607857", "version": "0.34.1", "version_code": 16779170, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26010917241877521", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27936345469334679"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "790503750728261"}]}, "change_log": "### v0.34.0\n\n**Reactive drills**\n- New REACTIVE category on the Train tab for read-and-react training. Nothing in these drills follows a script, so you can't memorize your way through them.\n- DON'T BITE is new: some pads come out for real, some start out and snap back. Hit the real ones, hold your fire on the fakes. Landing a punch on a fake counts against you. Hold A on the drill card for the full rules.\n- REACTIVE MIX is new: punch pads and incoming slips, ducks and pulls in one stream. Hit what comes out, evade what swings.\n- REACTIVE STRIKE is now pure punching, and when the same pad comes up twice in a row it rocks back off your fist before snapping out again.\n\n**Bag drills run until you're done**\n- Heavy bag, double-end bag and speed bag no longer have a timer. Box as long as you like, then pause and press FINISH DRILL to see your results. In workouts they still follow the workout clock.\n- The three timed heavy bag entries are now one HEAVY BAG drill.\n- The KEEP MOVING reminder no longer fires on any equipment drill.\n\n**Bag feel**\n- The heavy bag and double-end bag now soak up your punch for a split second before springing away, the way the speed bag does. The heavier the bag, the longer the soak.\n\n**Fixes**\n- Fixed the short video freezes in the menu right after starting the app, and when the first duck bar of a session appeared.", "created_date": 1784410588, "id": "27866625229640037", "version": "0.34.0", "version_code": 16779169, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}